                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "TIRED",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Octopus sushi! Just ONE more thingy—come on, come on!",
                            "zh": "章鱼寿司！现在就差一样食材啦——快点！快点！"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "TIRED",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "But hey, I really don't want that headache-y fella wrangling our wasabi!",
                            "zh": "当然，我可不希望那头疼的家伙套住我们的山葵！"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "TIRED",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "But hey—when the Octopus Zombie chucks his octopus, move the minecart, and your plant won't get wrangled! Gotta be FAST!",
                            "zh": "不过，章鱼僵尸扔出章鱼后，迅速挪开矿车就能防止矿车上的植物被套住，动作要快！"
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
